[00:30.52]1. Stay awake, stand firm, grow mighty,
[00:34.82]Be determined to endure.
[00:39.12]Carry on with manly courage,
[00:43.52]For the victory is sure.
[00:47.92]We obey Christ Jesus’ clear command;
[00:53.07]Under him we firmly take our stand.
[00:55.57](Chorus)
[00:58.07]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[01:02.07]Carry on right to the end!
[01:17.76]2. Stay awake, and keep your senses,
[01:21.52]Always ready to obey.
[01:25.96]Stay alert to Christ’s direction
[01:30.32]Through his faithful slave today.
[01:34.68]Heed the counsel of the older men,
[01:39.12]Who protect his sheep and truth defend.
[01:47.87](Chorus)
[01:56.63]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[02:00.77]Carry on right to the end!
[02:04.92]3. Stay awake, remain united
[02:09.06]As the good news we defend.
[02:13.21]Though our enemies will fight it,
[02:17.35]We will preach until the end.
[02:21.50]Join the shout of praise throughout the land.
[02:25.50]Look! Jehovah’s day is soon at hand!
[02:28.83](Chorus)
[02:32.17]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[02:35.50]Carry on right to the end!